From 52a3fd020965e54a3189da6403a610a9aa360f64 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefane Fermigier <sf@abilian.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 23:47:22 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 27/30] fix(pdf): name the trigger types the builder API's
 field actions use

pdf/apiBuilder.js read AscPDF.FORMS_TRIGGERS_TYPES in 22 places, a name
nothing defines, so setting a field's format, keystroke or validation
action through the builder API threw. The table is
AscPDF.PDF_TRIGGERS_TYPES (pdf/src/forms/formActions.js), which has the
Format, Keystroke and Validate keys used. Found by listing the
namespace members the engine reads that no file defines.

Assisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Stefane Fermigier <sf@abilian.com>
---
 pdf/apiBuilder.js | 44 ++++++++++++++++++++++----------------------
 1 file changed, 22 insertions(+), 22 deletions(-)

